WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Register connects PostgreSQL to New Relic.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:17.000
It checks that Kubernetes, PostgreSQL and New Relic are all available.

3
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:21.000
It sets up a read-only monitoring account inside PostgreSQL and checks that it can connect.

4
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:23.000
It stores those credentials as a secret, configures the New Relic PostgreSQL integration and restarts the agents.

5
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:36.000
PostgreSQL is registered into New Relic in 13 seconds.

